<title>UK: BT wins 147 mln stg deal to link up Lloyds.</title>
<headline>BT wins 147 mln stg deal to link up Lloyds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Monday it had won a 147 million stg, eight-year contract to install and maintain a custom-designed telecom network for Lloyds TSB Group Plc.</p>
</text>
